'''Tapu Koko ex''' (Japanese: '''カプ・コケコex''' ''Kapu-Kokeko ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

